---
/**
 * Nobody specifies edges, textures, parts or objects. Each layer applies a large
 * number of adjustable weights, the error is pushed back through all of them by
 * the chain rule, and what the layers converge on is whatever happens to reduce
 * that error — edges early, parts in the middle, objects late. The chart is the
 * moment the learned features beat the designed ones.
 */
